From e0e2d1e947ca639213123faef012281ad7ee4600 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: huadong zuo <zuohuadong@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 20 May 2026 00:09:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: harden backup timeout, shell abort, realtime trigger,
 and service health checks (#154)

* fix: harden backup timeout, shell abort, realtime trigger, and service health checks

- backup_manager.sh: add timeout 15 to pgbackrest list to prevent hanging
- shell.service.ts: add AbortController-based timeout (30s default) for script execution
- migrate-tenant-schema.ts: fix array-out-of-bounds in realtime trigger by using array_append
- tenant-runtime.service.ts: add checkDbHealth and checkStorageHealth with SQL/S3 fallback probes

Discovered during deep-test deployment cycle

* fix(management-api): harden shell timeouts and service health checks

---------

Co-authored-by: zuo <159921208@qq.com>
